<template name="saved-recovery"><view wx:if="{{savedMutation.frozen || savedMutation.receiptStatus || savedMutation.error}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">收藏与设置结果恢复</view><view class="notice">{{savedMutation.actionLabel}} · {{savedMutation.status}}</view><view wx:if="{{savedMutation.error}}" class="error">{{savedMutation.error}}</view><view class="status">{{savedMutation.receiptStatus}}</view><view wx:if="{{savedMutation.frozen}}"><button bindtap="onSavedReceipt" disabled="{{savedMutation.busy}}">查询原请求回执</button><button bindtap="onSavedRetry" disabled="{{savedMutation.busy}}">重试完全相同的原请求</button><navigator wx:if="{{savedMutation.recoveryPostId}}" class="link" url="/pages/community-detail/community-detail?postId={{savedMutation.recoveryPostId}}">原帖子与恢复入口 →</navigator></view><button wx:if="{{savedMutation.busy}}" bindtap="onSavedCancel">停止等待（不撤销请求）</button><view class="notice">未确认的请求不会被相反意图覆盖；关闭页面、换账号或重启后，仍保留在原账号下。回执只确认当时的请求，当前状态需重新读取。</view></view></template>
